<title>NIGERIA: Nestle Nigeria doubles after-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Nestle Nigeria doubles after-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Nestle Nigeria Plc to end-December 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>			     1996	  1995</p>
<p>Turnover		   6,100   vs 4,400</p>
<p>Profit before taxation 1,600   vs   837</p>
<p>Taxation		     325.8 vs   224.7</p>
<p>Profit after taxation  1,200   vs   612.8</p>
<p>Dividend - The company has proposed to pay 6.00 naira per share Scrip - It also proposes a one-for-one scrip issue. ($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
